{
  "key": 50267,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: ...This Pokémon always kept\n",
        "the sea lit at night.\r",
        "...But it suddenly got sick...\n",
        "It’s gasping for air...\r",
        "...I understand that there is a\n",
        "wonderful Pharmacy in Cianwood...\r",
        "But that’s across the sea...\n",
        "And I can’t leave Amphy unattended...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "...May I ask you to get some medicine\n",
        "for me? Please?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: ...Will that medicine cure\n",
        "Amphy? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} handed the SecretPotion\n",
        "to Jasmine."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: ...Um, please don’t be\n",
        "offended...\r",
        "Amphy will not take anything from\n",
        "anyone but me...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: ...\r",
        "Amphy, how are you feeling?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Amphy: Palu!\n",
        "Palulu!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: ...Oh, I’m so relieved...\n",
        "This is just so wonderful...\r",
        "Thank you so very, very much.\n",
        "...I will return to the Gym...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00008",
      "en_US": "Jasmine: ...I see...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00009",
      "en_US": "...Amphy, hang on!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Amphy: ...\n",
        "...Pa...paloo...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00011",
      "en_US": "Its breathing is slight..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0094_D27R0107_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Amphy: Palu!\n",
        "Palulu!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
